        "impact": "Any caller that relied on the base behavior for an empty input, where the count is 0, now gets an unhandled exception instead of 0. The search found no other callers of `average` in the head snapshot, so reachability within this repository is unconfirmed. For a public helper, this is still a behavioral regression.",
